{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42900","headline":"补茅鸱 二 · 丘光庭","name":"补茅鸱 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅鸱茅鸱，无啄我雀。\n汝食汝饱，莫我肯略。\n愿弹去汝，来彼瑞鹊。\n来彼瑞鹊，其音可乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}